      "body": "Police arrested five men during a drug investigation in Água Clara, Mato Grosso\ndo Sul, that began on the night of 4 November 2026. Four were booked on\nsuspicion of drug trafficking and association for trafficking; the fifth was\narrested under a judicial warrant. The operation began after Military\nPolice received a tip that a man was selling drugs from a white VW Gol in the\nJardim das Palmeiras neighbourhood. Officers pursued the driver for several\nblocks before stopping him. They found suspected cocaine in the car and\ncannabis portions, a scale, packaging material and cash at his home. The\ndriver was 30 years old. The Civil Police's General Investigations Section\nwas already investigating him.\n\nRCN67 reported that officers found 59 cannabis tablets weighing about 54 kg at a\nsecond property and arrested two men, aged 18 and 20, there. In the local\naccount, police located the two involved people at a snack bar. That\naccount placed the drug cache in woodland near the MS-324 highway.\nInvestigators later found another suspect, aged 22, with approximately 500 grams\nof cannabis and a scale.\n\nPolice also found a bag of cocaine that investigators believed the driver had\ndiscarded during the initial stop. The operation also yielded a car, a\nmotorcycle, three scales, three phones, packaging and approximately 250 reais in\ncash. The people initially found were taken to the Civil Police station in\nÁgua Clara for legal procedures.",
